- info   the identifiers of a network — hostnames, IP addresses, URLs, email addresses, ports, MAC addresses and DNS names — as typed values
+ info   gli identificatori di una rete — hostname, indirizzi IP, URL, indirizzi email, porte, indirizzi MAC e nomi DNS — come valori tipizzati

- detail
