-   entry #appropriate   runs a block which needs `Online`, or yields `Unset` if offline
+         Errore `↯/s.100.9`: _an Internet connection is not available_. Sollevato da
+         `Internet#require` su un `Internet` offline, e da `internetAccess.offline` non appena
